{"2644050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of Elysium", "steam_appid": 2644050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>MAJOR UPDATE AVAILABLE NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/f977587f3af4b4b571447b3d88ae530e.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1080 height=360 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to live on an airship? Now you have to. The serene skies of Elysium are both beautiful and deadly. Custom build floating fortresses, recruit your crew, and fight land and skyborne mechanisms in a paradise, filled with secrets, that wants you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 6 players in online co-op</strong>. Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where soul-powered clockwork beasts lurk in every corner. Gather resources, craft tools and airships, and survive across fractured biomes filled with danger and discovery.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airship isn’t just a base or transportation, it’s your home, your workshop, and your war machine. <strong>Customize every part</strong>, expand your fleet, and upgrade weapons to survive and explore the Elysian skies. From lumbering fortresses to nimble raiders, your design is the difference between glory and being scrap wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies of Elysium aren’t empty. <strong>Face the Heron faction</strong>, swarms of flying mechanical monsters, hostile towers, and an armada of airships bent on your destruction. Level up, unlock new abilities, and craft gear and parts to grow from a fragile skiff into a floating fortress for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/de3647fb208df1e7caa0f62d41178f5c.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Loric Games, we are a small but passionate team of 12 creating  immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/601799575cddf32f7612cdbfd3b86a5a.webp?t=1787269896\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to live on an airship? Now you have to. The serene skies of Elysium are both beautiful and deadly. Custom build floating fortresses, recruit your crew, and fight land and skyborne mechanisms in a paradise, filled with secrets, that wants you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 6 players in online co-op</strong>. Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where soul-powered clockwork beasts lurk in every corner. Gather resources, craft tools and airships, and survive across fractured biomes filled with danger and discovery.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airship isn’t just a base or transportation, it’s your home, your workshop, and your war machine. <strong>Customize every part</strong>, expand your fleet, and upgrade weapons to survive and explore the Elysian skies. From lumbering fortresses to nimble raiders, your design is the difference between glory and being scrap wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.poster.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.webm?t=1787269896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies of Elysium aren’t empty. <strong>Face the Heron faction</strong>, swarms of flying mechanical monsters, hostile towers, and an armada of airships bent on your destruction. Level up, unlock new abilities, and craft gear and parts to grow from a fragile skiff into a floating fortress for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/de3647fb208df1e7caa0f62d41178f5c.avif?t=1787269896\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Loric Games, we are a small but passionate team of 12 creating  immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/601799575cddf32f7612cdbfd3b86a5a.webp?t=1787269896\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Ever wanted to live on an airship? Now you have to. Echoes of Elysium is a co-op survival RPG where your airship is home, workshop, and war machine. Build a custom flying fortress, crew up with up to 6 players, and battle soul-powered clockwork beasts across a gorgeous, fractured sky.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Echoes of Elysium' Combines Final Fantasy Airships With the Co-Op Chaos of Sea of Thieves”<br>Inverse<br><br>“It's a game where you live out the fantasy of being a sky warrior by building a sick airship so you and your friends can rule the skies.”<br>TheGamer<br><br>“Purpose-built co-op, customization, and playstyle flexibility appear to be the crown jewels of Echoes of Elysium.”<br>GameRant<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/3c119709370ea8664dc65e9f9d128e810ff00e54/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787269896", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/45d2eadd4eb7f5151e6ec8a393c48e41d5074976/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787269896", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/45d2eadd4eb7f5151e6ec8a393c48e41d5074976/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787269896", "website": "https://www.echoes.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (